2\u73bb\u7483\u80cc\u666f\u53ca\u53ef\u8c03\u900f\u660e\u5ea6\u3001\u4e94\u79cd\u5f3a\u8c03\u8272\u3001\u5168\u9009/\u53cd\u9009\u3001\u8de8\u9875\u62d6\u52a8\u6392\u5e8f\u4e0e\u64a4\u9500\u3001\u663e\u793a\u540d\u79f0\u548c\u66ff\u4ee3\u56fe\u6807\u3001\u5206\u7ec4/\u6536\u85cf/\u641c\u7d22\u3001\u8bb0\u4f4f\u9875\u7801\u548c\u51cf\u5c11\u52a8\u753b\u3001\u672c\u5730\u5907\u4efd\u4e0e\u5bfc\u5165\u9884\u89c8\u3002\u4fdd\u7559\u5feb\u901f\u91cd\u5f00\u548c\u6253\u5f00\u5e94\u7528\u540e\u6536\u8d77\u83dc\u5355\u3002\\n\\nKeep circular icons, staggered layouts and horizontal pages. New transparent/frosted icon-area material with adjustable transparency, five accent colors, batch selection, cross-page drag reorder and undo, shortcut names and replacement icons, groups/favorites/search, page memory and reduced motion, local backups and import previews. Quick reopen and automatic menu closing are retained.\\n\\nBackground blur depends on system support. Backups exclude app installers and other apps\u2019 private data. No accounts, ads or automatic cloud sync.\"", "created_date": 1791574726, "id": "1487952953143951", "version": "1.0.1", "version_code": 6, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1486063019999611", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1486070619998851"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2375379952869542"}]}, "change_log": "\"Initial release: personal installed-app shortcuts, icon organization, paging and local privacy controls.\"", "created_date": 1791386796, "id": "1486070619998851", "version": "0.2.0", "version_code": 4, "release_status": "RELEASE